  "releaseNotes": "10.0.37: feat - ProjectTo now projects nested complex members and collections of complex elements (e.g. ICollection of TChildModel -> ICollection of TChildDto) element-by-element, matching the in-memory Map path and fixing the InvalidCastException it previously threw. Adds ExplicitExpansion() and ProjectTo(config, membersToExpand) to opt members out of / into projection. Backward compatible. See https://github.com/panoramicdata/PanoramicData.Mapper/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for details.",
